  "description": "Seo Jian transmigrates into a novel called *Rut Partner*. When other people transmigrate, they struggle for a bit and then go on to live comfortably—so why is he the only one suffering in poverty? While lamenting his exhausting reality, one day he ends up becoming someone’s rut partner almost against his will. > “Everyone else is allowed, but I’m not? There’s no way that’s true.” Was it physical attachment, affection… or perhaps even love? After the relationship suddenly comes to an end, Jian is left with an inexplicable sense of emptiness. Then he meets Choi Eden — a man who somehow reminds him of the person hidden in the darkness….\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/landing/episode/12402), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5265000647), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Rut_Partner), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/rut_partner), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000078375), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14363517), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260366)",
